        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-776 (ensure controlled execution — Custom Project Sourcing Intake &amp; Quotation (PA-182.1).) | - operational: vendor compliance check at indent intake, technical compliance verification sign-off required prior to RFQ launch.
Owner: B2B Sourcing Manager</bpmn:text>
