      <bpmn:userTask id="W5227_Task6" name="Gather FOB pricing, ocean freight rates, insurance, drayage, and customs tariff…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Gather FOB pricing, ocean freight rates, insurance, drayage, and customs tariff estimates.
Responsible (R): Import Buyer
Accountable (A): Logistics Finance Analyst
Duration: 2-3 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5227_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5227_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5227_Task7" name="Input variables to Landed Cost Calculator; estimate duties, VAT, brokerage…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Input variables to Landed Cost Calculator; estimate duties, VAT, brokerage fees, and port charges.
Responsible (R): Logistics Finance Analyst
Accountable (A): Logistics Finance Analyst
Duration: 1-2 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5227_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5227_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5227_Task8" name="Apply margin matrix matching B2B project guidelines (target gross margin &gt;=18%…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Apply margin matrix matching B2B project guidelines (target gross margin &gt;=18% for custom bulk).
Responsible (R): Category Manager
Accountable (A): Logistics Finance Analyst
Duration: 1 hour</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5227_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5227_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5227_Task9" name="Generate project pricing proposal and submit to VP Merchandising for approval.">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Generate project pricing proposal and submit to VP Merchandising for approval.
Responsible (R): Logistics Finance Analyst
Accountable (A): Logistics Finance Analyst
Duration: 30 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5227_Flow16</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
