Accountable (A): Supplier Quality Liaison / Global Sourcing Coordinator
Duration: 1 hour</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5231_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5231_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5231_Task7" name="Escalate potential production delays to Sourcing Manager and adjust timeline…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Escalate potential production delays to Sourcing Manager and adjust timeline projections.
Responsible (R): Global Sourcing Coordinator
Accountable (A): Supplier Quality Liaison / Global Sourcing Coordinator
Duration: 1 hour</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5231_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5231_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5231_Task8" name="Update project dashboard in ERP with current ETA projections.">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Update project dashboard in ERP with current ETA projections.
Responsible (R): Supplier Quality Liaison
Accountable (A): Supplier Quality Liaison / Global Sourcing Coordinator
Duration: 30 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5231_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
