        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-776 (ensure controlled execution — Custom Project Sourcing Intake &amp; Quotation (PA-182.1).) | - operational: receiving-fraud gate on indent shipments; QA Director formal sign-off on PSI reports.
Owner: Quality Assurance Manager</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
